<title>BANGLADESH: Port conditions update - Bangladesh - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Bangladesh - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>MONGLA, April 20 - Stevedores labourers strike called off. Loading and unloading restored from 1900 local time, April 19. Work had been suspended from 1900 local time, April 15.</p>
</text>
